<title>BOTSWANA: Botswana Sept consumer inflation rises 9.7 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Botswana Sept consumer inflation rises 9.7 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Botswana's all items consumer price index rose 0.5 per cent in September from August, bringing the year-on-year increase to 9.7 percent, the Central Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				Sept 1996	 Aug 1996	Sept 1995</p>
<p>    Yr/Yr pct change    9.7		 9.9	     10.8</p>
<p>    All-items index     173.9	     173.0	   158.5</p>
<p>Note: Index November 1991 = 100</p>
<p>-- Gaborone newsroom +267 347-182</p>
